    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels so permanent though. like it's not just a bad mood, it's just who i am now. everything i used to care about feels fake. i'm just tired of pretending there's still something inside me to pull from. it's exhausting to keep trying to force a light that went out years ago.",
